+// [E, in/16, out/16, packed] uint16, the scales float16/uint16 bit
+// patterns, slots uint32/int32 router ids, scores the router
+// probabilities. |window| is the pack's codeword window (runtime config
+// in sushi, so it is an explicit argument here). Composed and unfused:
+// correct on every stream, slow everywhere; the fused GPU arms land
+// with the M3d work.
